# CapturePro App - Production Environment Variables
# This file contains all required environment variables for Cloudflare Pages deployment

# =============================================
# REQUIRED: Supabase Configuration
# =============================================
# These MUST be configured for the app to function

# Supabase Project URL
# Get from: Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://xtihebyjngwjdyljfrl.supabase.co

# Supabase Anonymous Key (Public Key - safe to expose)
# Get from: Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key_here

# =============================================
# REQUIRED: Stripe Configuration
# =============================================
# Required for payment processing

# Stripe Publishable Key (Public Key - safe to expose)
# Get from: Stripe Dashboard → Developers → API Keys
VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your_stripe_publishable_key_here

# =============================================
# OPTIONAL: App Configuration
# =============================================
# These have sensible defaults if not set

# Public App URL (defaults to https://capturepro.work if not set)
VITE_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://capturepro.work

# =============================================
# CLOUDFLARE PAGES DEPLOYMENT INSTRUCTIONS
# =============================================
#
# 1. Navigate to Cloudflare Dashboard
#    https://dash.cloudflare.com/
#
# 2. Go to: Workers & Pages → capturepro-app → Settings → Environment variables
#
# 3. Add the following variables under "Production" environment:
#    - VITE_SUPABASE_URL
#    - VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
#    - VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY
#    - VITE_PUBLIC_APP_URL (optional)
#
# 4. IMPORTANT: After adding variables, trigger a new deployment
#    - Go to: Deployments tab
#    - Click "Create deployment" or push a new commit
#    - The new build will include the environment variables
#
# 5. CRITICAL: These are BUILD-TIME variables (not runtime)
#    - All variables starting with VITE_ are embedded in the JavaScript bundle during build
#    - Changes to environment variables require a new deployment to take effect
#    - The variables will NOT update on existing deployments
#
# =============================================
# VERIFICATION
# =============================================
#
# After deployment, verify the app loads correctly:
# 1. Visit https://app.capturepro.net
# 2. Check browser console for any "Missing environment variables" errors
# 3. If you see a "Configuration Error" screen, verify all variables are set in Cloudflare
#
# =============================================
# TROUBLESHOOTING
# =============================================
#
# White screen after payment redirect:
# - Ensure all VITE_SUPABASE_* variables are configured in Cloudflare Pages
# - Trigger a new deployment after adding variables
# - Clear browser cache and try again
#
# "App configuration error" message:
# - Check Cloudflare Pages environment variables are set correctly
# - Verify no typos in variable names (case-sensitive)
# - Ensure values don't contain quotes or extra spaces
#
# Variables not taking effect:
# - Remember: VITE_ variables are build-time only
# - You MUST deploy after changing environment variables
# - Wait for the new deployment to complete
# - Hard refresh your browser (Ctrl+Shift+R or Cmd+Shift+R)
